{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/410982-dark-eras-crossover-changeling-and-geist","id":410982,"title":"Dark Eras Crossover Changeling and Geist","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-18T20:46:53-08:00","id":410982,"title":"Dark Eras Crossover Changeling and Geist","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminated Minutia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/360610-wod-dark-eras-was-ages-kickstarter-questions?p=410585#post410585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">They put up the options for the dual line poll on the Kickstarter main page.</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Changeling &amp; Geist:</b> Three Kingdoms China (~240) </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Vampire &amp; Promethean:</b> Europe's Black Death (~1350) </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Mage &amp; Mummy:</b> French Revolution (~1790s)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Vote China!</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Prepare the battlements!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxus