ank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T14:21:52-08:00","id":414433,"title":"","content":"Alright, if we're going to play this game, we need to get a few things straight...<br /> <br /> So first things first: What's the equivalent of POL, and where would a specialty (or would it be a merit?) in organizing farms or developing markets be most appropriate? I need to know what stats I want to look for before spamming a few courtiers off to develop farms until they hit FARM cap, and are sent off to the next province, repeating ad infinitum until the end of their unnaturally extended lives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5120-wraith_magus","name":"Wraith_Magus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T15:42:23-08:00","id":414530,"title":"","content":"Politics skill, clearly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T16:47:12-08:00","id":414609,"title":"","content":"At 48% Changeling appears to have a large early lead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T17:21:02-08:00","id":414625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/410982-dark-eras-crossover-changeling-and-geist?p=414530#post414530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Politics skill, clearly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I meant it as a Koei joke, but if we take this seriously...<br /> <br /> &quot;POL&quot; was always a bad name for it. (Or maybe translation of it?) Sort of like how WAR was how strong you are, what POL actually did in the game was mainly focused in two actions: Improving farms, and developing commerce. (Or in other words, it was your &quot;make money&quot; stat.)<br /> <br /> Improving farms largely seems based around helping build rice paddies, which are notoriously labor-intensive to actually set up properly, especially if you're talking about those terraced hillsides or the like. Hence, POL in this case means the capacity to draft large numbers of laborers and direct them to complete large-scale engineering projects of irrigation and earthmoving. <br /> <br /> Developing commerce seems a little more vague, but largely seems to involve a combination of funding start-up businesses and making arrangements with established merchants to help kickstart a local economy.<br /> <br /> The politics skill as it exists in WoD is mostly about navigating bureaucracies, especially in getting someone who outranks you or doesn't answer to you to do what you want using their official duties. This would more be like making deals or inspiring people. I could see the farm thing as two separate rolls, one involving Manipulation or Presence and Persuasion to get workers together, while the other requires Intelligence and Craft to do the actual engineering. Manipulation and Persuasion for negotiation combined with a possible Wits and Empathy or maybe even Streetwise for finding the right people to invest in on the economics side. <br /> <br /> In any event, I'd expect more role playing than the rather dry &quot;Spreadsheet Strategy&quot; of a classic Koei game. Simply punching buttons to make numbers go up until you were rolling in cash is about as anathema to the themes of nWoD as one could possibly get.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5120-wraith_magus","name":"Wraith_Magus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T02:00:07-08:00","id":414989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wraith_Magus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/410982-dark-eras-crossover-changeling-and-geist?p=414625#post414625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In any event, I'd expect more role playing than the rather dry &quot;Spreadsheet Strategy&quot; of a classic Koei game. Simply punching buttons to make numbers go up until you were rolling in cash is about as anathema to the themes of nWoD as one could possibly get.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, it's not like WoD's really designed for large-scale agriculture simulation at it's best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T13:39:56-08:00","id":415605,"title":"","content":"And, coming in with a near-outright-majority, RotTK drives its opponents from the field like Zhang Fei drives Wei cowards from a bridge at Changban!<br /> <br /> ... Now this means I have to care about Geist, I guess. I never did get around to actually getting the rulebook...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5120-wraith_magus","name":"Wraith_Magus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T14:41:16-08:00","id":415727,"title":"","content":"You should, it is awesome. <b>Geist</b> and <b>Changeling</b> are neck and neck for my favorite WoD game...usually my favorite is whichever of the two I am playing at the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=